{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1000_null", "source_sha256": "9ffb2539d2508287d7b4fb093b042e6d03b74448fa3828a5ec5e4c0e9c985e85", "ja": "定期公演の準備中……", "zh": "定期公演准备中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "0b5bb107491b0ad710e1be52f1ab80cac1d2969dda6461a6c83839e535f712fe", "ja": "さあ、今日は定期公演に使う素材の撮影だ。\nとりあえず、気軽にバンバン撮っていこう！", "zh": "那么，今天要拍摄定期公演要用的素材。\n总之，轻松地多拍一些吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "b6d7d295addaedbe8d83a54a426d29b369c55ad371368b64e3ad0de16c94f1e3", "ja": "おや～？\n何やら向こうに、人が集まっていますね～。", "zh": "哎呀～？\n那边好像聚集了不少人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "40ac00faee16ffab4956247aba49c154e6aba8f233497c8eeac2a9ee0a333f72", "ja": "ああ、向こうも撮影隊かな。こっちも撮影許可は\n取ってるし、心配はいらないよ。", "zh": "啊，那边也是拍摄团队吧。我们这边也已经取得拍摄许可了，不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "eadc618fdd1c51f538f10de94ee0a5df07a387346728e94a6ce03a731875475a", "ja": "はい～。それにしても、大勢いますね～。\n通りがかりの人も、どんどん足を止めています～。", "zh": "是呀～不过话说回来，人还真多呢～。\n连路过的人也纷纷停下脚步了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "0a5a4535d5214833f44494b15abf04bffc7cd85169474b9ac9e7cf1008d79fb8", "ja": "そうだな……けっこうな大所帯での撮影みたいだ。", "zh": "是啊……看起来像是在进行一场规模不小的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "15bd9c0cfa7380fa9e974d7773f4458a47aef4deba0ab509e0dc5e246fc0dd9b", "ja": "あの真ん中にいる人、見たことありますよ～。\nテレビか……、どこかの看板だったでしょうか～。", "zh": "我好像见过站在正中央的那个人哦～  \n是在电视上……还是哪里的广告牌上来着～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "0241be29b3e9be4b474f5d10b78d021244720f7e92cacb90e59a4c64afd90cca", "ja": "（超売れっ子の人気アイドルだ。どうりで撮影も\n大がかりなはずだ。……こっちは最低限の人数だけど）", "zh": "（是个超级走红的人气偶像。难怪拍摄阵仗这么大……我们这边却只来了最少的人手。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "f64bb0ce5051f61b90dfe0ab74a5e3b1c17f9a79678238a13caa7907f49b7230", "ja": "年は私と同じぐらいに見えるのに。\nすごいですね～。", "zh": "明明看着年纪跟我差不多大。\n真厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "6d63cadc043ec83963b9c33b157d4b390de1b9e73de27686313a995a16567303", "ja": "ん？　うん……そうだな。", "zh": "嗯？嗯……确实呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "942f5f33bfbdcd504105888ed5d88f2180972573dccd1f94e60454e1ff65e353", "ja": "周りの野次馬さんたちにも手を振っています～。\nなるほど、あんなふうに振るまえばいいんですな～。", "zh": "也在向周围看热闹的人挥手呢～。\n原来如此～要像那样表现才行啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f0482422bed56fb92de484aba68e90c897d2c51a8283247da1d0658ed6488c6", "ja": "野次馬さんが大勢集まった時です～。興味を持ってくれ\nたんですから、喜んでもらったほうがいいですよね～。", "zh": "就是有很多看热闹的人聚集起来的时候～。既然他们对这件事产生了兴趣，那还是让他们高兴一点比较好，对吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "294211585a6c94cd609a382b521578e70c973771806f0c4b21bca03e844d192f", "ja": "？　プロデューサーさん？　ぼんやりして、\nどうしましたか～？　私の顔に何かついてますか～？", "zh": "？制作人？您刚才在发呆，怎么了～？我的脸上有什么东西吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "4360029f32952e810d1425bfd1e21ffea8ed321e235912420d5cf02957590d8b", "ja": "あ、いや……。", "zh": "啊，不是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "6d1e7af962e57ee9dedfa29f202b7a2a5d97f2321fc3e86364c823c5aa900a2e", "ja": "（俺が比較してる場合じゃない。美也たちもすぐ、\nあんなふうになる……いや、するんだ！）", "zh": "（现在可不是拿来比较的时候。美也她们也会马上变成那样……不，是要让她们变成那样！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "fd00beee8829b5b3a6b5cccbdcd6acb003da9d72b26cb17a235c300a7a51026d", "ja": "プロデューサーさんや、朋花ちゃんやまつりちゃん、\n劇場のみんなと～。", "zh": "还有制作人、朋花、茉莉，以及剧场的大家～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "b7f103994e169bedf424be952ef58ce509361653318d50ad70109070363d859f", "ja": "もうすぐ私も、あんなふうに真ん中に立ちますよ～。\nいまから楽しみです～。", "zh": "再过不久，我也要像那样站在正中央了哦～\n从现在开始就很期待了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "29953c6355cc1faa120585e0cfd2d9af29fd677aaa126b62a05f8666e5debad9", "ja": "美也……！\nうん、そうだ。その通りだ！", "zh": "美也……！嗯，对，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "56c189baff0043f4c8eec6993d874bbe5fe70874b1f3ffdb616ec37ae234df81", "ja": "そのためにまず、今度の公演を大成功させよう。\nそして次も、その次の公演も！", "zh": "为此，首先要让这次公演取得圆满成功。\n然后是下一次、再下一次的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0613_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "59241a87eb1ceb29cd7d048477118e5652f332af373cd6b422ed53c867240ce9", "ja": "むふふ♪　プロデューサーさんはよくばりですな～。\nでも、任せてください、頑張りますよ～。むんっ！", "zh": "呜夫夫♪ 制作人真贪心呢～  \n不过，交给我吧，我会努力的～！嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
